      "content": "it's just so weird how everything happened at the exact same time. i even saw one of the former directors from my old department driving through my neighborhood last week—he doesn't live anywhere near here. then my neighbor, who's always been friendly, won't even look me in the eye anymore. does that sound like anything to you? i feel like if i'm just being paranoid, i'm losing my mind, but it's too much to be random.",
